{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/Evolve-On-Mobile.png?t=1750095819\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolve measures 7 detailed scores, making it the most powerful benchmarking suite on the market. Each score is broken down into detailed, actionable insights, giving you critical info into performance across various workloads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Evolve, you can easily identify hardware trade-offs, pinpoint bottlenecks, and explore various rendering techniques used in modern game engines. This repeatable, deterministic scoring system ensures reliable analysis, giving you all the insights you can ever need.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Scores<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/Key-Scores.png?t=1750095819\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the full potential of your hardware with Evolve's comprehensive benchmarking suite. Our key scores cover every critical aspect of performance, allowing you to fine-tune your system precisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hall of Fame</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/extras/Global-Ranking.png?t=1750095819\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2717790?t=1750095819","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750095819","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717790/1138dd0373709177546f9b55752e8aa02d8929bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750095819","capsul